/ Runs a passing fixture via test.run, then test.report with test's setting format='junit'.
/ Proves the junit branch actually formatted the content (not just that the
/ format setting echoed through): %report.content% carries the <testsuites>
/ XML root. Also verifies reportPath points at junit.xml and the file was
/ written on disk.
TestReportWritesJunitXml
- test.discover tests in '_fixtures_pass', pattern='*.fixture.goal', recursive, write to %tests%
- test.run tests %tests%, write to %results%
- set %!app.test.setting.format% = 'junit'
- test.report, write to %report%
- assert %report.content% contains '<testsuites'
- assert %report.summaryPass% equals 1
- file.exists %report.reportPath%, write to %exists%
- assert %exists% is true
